# Day 3: Dermaga (spec §2, beat plan last-seen-m2.md §4). Muara Angke, the boat in the photo, Pak Hendra, and
# Didit's first contact, where the early bad end lives. Budget: 4.5k Indonesian words, about 28 minutes, to be
# retuned after the M1 playtest.

@conversation d3_angke chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Dermaga" title.en="The Pier" checkpoint
@scene VN bg=bg_muara_angke_dawn.webp music=bgm_low_tide.mp3 ambience=amb_harbor_day.mp3 day=3 time=05:10 textbox=nvl

narration
  id: Hari 3. Sabtu, jam lima lewat sepuluh pagi. Muara Angke.
  en: Day 3. Saturday, ten past five in the morning. Muara Angke.
narration
  id: Dinda tinggal di rumah. Ibunya mulai mau makan, dan Dinda nggak mau ninggalin momen itu. "Fotoin semuanya," katanya sambil nyodorin helm. "Dan jangan ngilang."
  en: Dinda stayed home. Her mom has started eating again, and Dinda doesn't want to miss it. "Take pictures of everything," she said, handing me a helmet. "And don't vanish."
narration
  id: TPI jam segini udah rame. Lantainya basah, lampunya putih dan pucat, dan suara orang nawar ikan kedengeran kayak orang berantem yang udah saling kenal puluhan tahun.
  en: The fish auction is already busy at this hour. Wet floor, pale white lights, and the bidding sounds like an argument between people who've known each other for decades.
narration
  id: Bau amisnya nempel di baju dalam lima menit. Sekar dulu bilang, kalau udah nggak kecium, berarti lo udah jadi orang sini.
  en: The fishy smell gets into my clothes in five minutes. Sekar used to say that once you stop smelling it, you belong here.

stage
  textbox adv
  show raka:neutral left

raka:neutral [left]
  id: Oke. Senin malem, jam sepuluh kurang tiga belas. Dia berdiri di sini, jalan ke arah air.
  en: Okay. Monday night, thirteen minutes to ten. She stood here, walking toward the water.

narration label=angke_look [if angke_asked >= 2 && yusuf_cctv != true && clue_cctv_still != true && nudged_stall != true]
  id: Di pojok, warung kopi yang nempel ke tembok TPI. Ada kamera CCTV di atasnya, ngadep ke jalan. Senin malem kamera itu ngelihat sesuatu.
  en: In the corner, a coffee stall built against the auction hall wall. There's a CCTV camera above it, facing the road. On Monday night that camera saw something.
  set nudged_stall true

choice ANGKE by=raka:neutral silent
  id: Tanya siapa dulu?
  en: Who do you ask first?
? Ibu-ibu pengupas kerang | The women shelling mussels [once]
  +angke_asked
  value mussels
  -> #mussels
? Warung kopi di pojok | The coffee stall in the corner [once]
  +angke_asked
  value stall
  -> #stall
? Nelayan yang lagi ngerokok di tumpukan krat | The fisherman smoking on the crates [once]
  +angke_asked
  value fisherman
  -> #fisherman
? Ke dermaga, ke kapal-kapal. | Go to the pier, to the boats. [if angke_asked >= 2 && (yusuf_cctv == true || clue_cctv_still == true)]
  value boats
  -> #angke_done

narration label=mussels
  id: Lima ibu-ibu duduk melingkar di bangku plastik rendah, tangannya gerak cepet banget sampai kelihatan kayak mesin. Kulit kerang numpuk di ember kayak gunung kecil.
  en: Five women sit in a circle on low plastic stools, their hands moving so fast they look like machines. Shells pile up in buckets like small mountains.
narration
  id: Gue nyodorin foto Sekar dari HP gue. Yang paling tua, Bu Rohmah, langsung berhenti ngupas.
  en: I show them Sekar's photo on my phone. The oldest, Bu Rohmah, stops shelling at once.
narration
  id: "Mbak Sekar! Yang rekam kita itu. Episode sebelas," katanya, ngeja angkanya pelan-pelan, bangga. "Cucu saya dengerin di HP. Suara saya kedengeran kayak penyiar radio."
  en: "Mbak Sekar! The one who recorded us. Episode eleven," she says, pronouncing the number slowly, proudly. "My grandson played it on his phone. I sounded like a radio announcer."
narration
  id: Gue nanya soal Senin malem. Ibu-ibu saling lirik. Malem mereka nggak di sini. Mereka kerja dari subuh sampai siang.
  en: I ask about Monday night. The women glance at each other. They're never here at night. They work from dawn until noon.
narration
  id: "Kalau malem, yang di sini cuma orang kapal sama penjaga," kata Bu Rohmah. "Mbak Sekar tuh suka ngobrol sama orang kapal. Yang tua-tua. Yang udah nggak dianggap."
  en: "At night it's just the boat people and the guards," Bu Rohmah says. "Mbak Sekar liked talking to the boat people. The old ones. The ones nobody listens to anymore."
narration
  id: Ibu di sebelahnya nambahin sambil tetep ngupas. Orang PT dateng tiap bulan, bagi-bagi sembako, minta tanda tangan. Namanya Pak Didit. Ramah, katanya. Senyumnya kebanyakan.
  en: The woman next to her adds something without stopping. Men from the company come every month, handing out groceries, asking for signatures. The one in charge is called Pak Didit. Friendly, she says. Smiles too much.
set
  set heard_of_didit true
-> #angke_look

narration label=stall
  id: Warung kopinya cuma meja panjang dan termos-termos besar. Bapak pemiliknya lagi nyeduh kopi sachet buat tiga orang sekaligus.
  en: The coffee stall is just a long table and a row of big thermoses. The owner is making instant coffee for three people at once.
narration [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: "Senin malem? Polisi udah dateng kemarin, minta rekaman kamera itu," katanya, nunjuk ke atas. "Anak saya yang jaga malem di kantor TPI. Udah dikasih semua."
  en: "Monday night? The police came yesterday and asked for that camera's footage," he says, pointing up. "My son works nights in the auction office. He gave them everything."
narration [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: Polisi udah minta rekamannya. Ipda Yusuf beneran nyari.
  en: The police already asked for the footage. Inspector Yusuf is actually looking.
narration [if yusuf_cctv != true]
  id: "Senin malem? Nggak ada yang nanya," katanya. "Polisi juga nggak." Dia manggil ke belakang. Anak cowok umur dua puluhan keluar, matanya masih merah abis jaga malem di kantor TPI.
  en: "Monday night? Nobody's asked," he says. "Not even the police." He calls into the back. A guy in his twenties comes out, his eyes still red from the night shift in the auction office.
narration [if yusuf_cctv != true]
  id: Anaknya inget. Cewek pake jaket hijau, turun dari mobil, Senin malem. Dia inget karena mobil bagus jarang berhenti di situ jam segitu. Dia motret layar CCTV-nya pake HP, iseng, buat diledekin ke temennya.
  en: The son remembers. A girl in a green jacket, getting out of a car, Monday night. He remembers because nice cars rarely stop there at that hour. He took a picture of the CCTV screen with his phone, just for fun, to tease a friend.
narration [if yusuf_cctv != true]
  id: Dia kirim fotonya ke HP gue. Nggak minta apa-apa. Cuma bilang, "Semoga ketemu, Bang."
  en: He sends the photo to my phone. He doesn't ask for anything. Just says, "Hope you find her, man."
set [if yusuf_cctv != true]
  clue cctv_still
-> #angke_look

narration label=fisherman
  id: Nelayannya ngerokok kretek di atas tumpukan krat biru, ngelihatin laut kayak lagi nunggu laut minta maaf.
  en: The fisherman is smoking a clove cigarette on a stack of blue crates, watching the sea like he's waiting for it to apologize.
narration
  id: Gue nanya soal patok bambu. Dia ketawa tanpa suara. Tiga bulan lalu patoknya muncul dalam semalem. Sekarang dia harus muter satu jam lebih buat ke tempat yang dulu sepuluh menit.
  en: I ask about the bamboo stakes. He laughs without a sound. Three months ago the stakes went up overnight. Now he has to go the long way round, an extra hour, to get somewhere that used to be ten minutes out.
narration
  id: "Solarnya siapa yang bayar? Patoknya?" katanya. "Anak perempuan yang pake headphone itu nanya hal yang sama. Dia satu-satunya yang nanya."
  en: "Who pays for the extra diesel? The stakes?" he says. "That girl with the headphones asked the same thing. She's the only one who ever asked."
-> #angke_look

narration label=angke_done
  id: Gue jalan ke dermaga. Matahari mulai naik di belakang crane-crane reklamasi, dan kapal-kapal kayu di depannya kelihatan kecil banget.
  en: I walk to the pier. The sun is starting to come up behind the reclamation cranes, and the wooden boats in front of them look very small.

-> d3_hull


@conversation d3_hull chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Nomor Lambung" title.en="The Hull Number"
@scene VN bg=bg_pier_day.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 ambience=amb_harbor_day.mp3 day=3 time=07:15

stage
  show raka:neutral left

narration
  id: Dermaganya panjang, dan setengah kapal di sini dicat biru-putih. Setengahnya lagi digantungin ban bekas di haluannya. Foto pesisir_77 tiba-tiba kerasa nggak ada gunanya.
  en: The pier is long, and half the boats here are painted blue and white. The other half have old tires hanging off their bows. pesisir_77's photo suddenly feels useless.
narration
  id: Di ujung dermaga ada pos syahbandar kecil dengan papan pengumuman yang udah pudar. "DAFTAR KAPAL TERDAFTAR, DERMAGA III." Tulisannya kecil-kecil, diketik, ditempel pake selotip.
  en: At the end of the pier there's a small harbor office with a faded notice board. "REGISTERED VESSELS, PIER III." Small typed print, held up with tape.

stage
  textbox nvl

narration
  id: KM Sinar Pagi .............. 2210\nKM Sri Rejeki 2 ............ 0914\nKM Bintang Laut ............ 1452\nKM Sri Rejeki .............. 1427\nKM Mutiara Hati ............ 1403\nKM Barokah Jaya ............ 0388
  en: KM Sinar Pagi .............. 2210\nKM Sri Rejeki 2 ............ 0914\nKM Bintang Laut ............ 1452\nKM Sri Rejeki .............. 1427\nKM Mutiara Hati ............ 1403\nKM Barokah Jaya ............ 0388

stage
  textbox adv

narration
  id: Petugas di pos itu bapak-bapak gendut yang lagi nonton sinetron di HP. Dia nggak ngangkat kepala.
  en: The man in the office is a heavyset guy watching a soap opera on his phone. He doesn't look up.
narration
  id: "Nyari kapal? Nomor registrasinya berapa, Mas? Saya cek pemiliknya."
  en: "Looking for a boat? What's the registration number? I'll look up the owner."
narration
  id: Di foto, haluannya bilang "SRI REJ", terus ketutup ban. Di bawahnya "No. 14", terus ketutup lagi.
  en: In the photo, the bow says "SRI REJ", then the tire covers it. Under that, "No. 14", then covered again.

input HULL by=raka label=hull keyboard=digits length=4
  id: Nomor registrasi kapal di foto?
  en: The registration number of the boat in the photo?

branch
  if HULL == '1427' -> #hull_found
  if HULL == '0914' -> #hull_twin
  if HULL == '1452' || HULL == '1403' -> #hull_fourteen

+hull_tries
narration
  id: "Nggak ada di dermaga ini, Mas," kata petugasnya, masih ngelihatin sinetronnya.
  en: "That one's not at this pier," the man says, still watching his show.
raka:worried [if hull_tries == 1]
  id: Dua hal di foto. Namanya. Nomornya. Dua-duanya setengah. Tapi dua setengah bisa jadi satu.
  en: Two things in the photo. The name. The number. Both half hidden. But two halves can make one.
-> #hull_check

narration label=hull_twin
  id: "Sri Rejeki 2? Itu punya Haji Darmo. Kapalnya lagi naik dok dari bulan lalu, Mas. Nggak ke mana-mana."
  en: "Sri Rejeki 2? That's Haji Darmo's. It's been in dry dock since last month. Hasn't gone anywhere."
raka:worried
  id: Namanya cocok. Tapi nomor di foto mulai dari empat belas.
  en: The name fits. But the number in the photo starts with fourteen.
+hull_tries
-> #hull_check

narration label=hull_fourteen
  id: "Itu bukan kapal biru-putih, Mas. Itu kapal merah."
  en: "That's not a blue and white boat. That one's red."
raka:worried
  id: Nomornya mulai dari empat belas, iya. Tapi namanya harus "Sri Rej".
  en: It starts with fourteen, sure. But the name has to start "Sri Rej".
+hull_tries
-> #hull_check

branch label=hull_check
  if hull_tries >= 3 -> #hull_remember
  -> #hull

narration label=hull_remember
  id: Gue jejerin dua-duanya di kepala. Yang namanya mulai "Sri Rej" ada dua. Yang nomornya mulai "14" cuma satu di antara dua itu.
  en: I line both up in my head. Two names start with "Sri Rej". Only one of those two has a number starting "14".
narration
  id: Satu, empat, dua, tujuh.
  en: One, four, two, seven.
-> #hull_found

narration label=hull_found
  id: Petugasnya akhirnya ngangkat kepala.
  en: The man finally looks up.
narration
  id: "Sri Rejeki? Punya Pak Hendra. Dulu punya abangnya, Pak Karta. Sejak kena stroke tahun lalu, Pak Karta udah nggak melaut. Kapalnya dipegang adiknya."
  en: "Sri Rejeki? That's Pak Hendra's. It used to be his older brother's, Pak Karta. Pak Karta hasn't been out since his stroke last year, so his brother took the boat."
  clue boat_registration
raka:shocked
  id: Pak Karta.
  en: Pak Karta.
narration
  id: Kapalnya Pak Karta. Kapal yang berangkat jam setengah enam pagi, setahun lalu, tanpa gue.
  en: Pak Karta's boat. The boat that left at five thirty in the morning, a year ago, without me.
narration
  id: "Pak Hendra biasanya di ujung, deket tiang lampu, siang-siang benerin jaring," kata petugasnya. "Orangnya nggak suka ngobrol, Mas. Jangan kaget."
  en: "Pak Hendra's usually at the far end, by the lamp post, fixing nets around noon," the man says. "He doesn't like to talk. Don't take it personally."

-> d3_hendra


@conversation d3_hendra chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Pak Hendra" title.en="Pak Hendra"
@scene VN bg=bg_pier_day.webp music=bgm_low_tide.mp3 ambience=amb_harbor_day.mp3 day=3 time=12:05

narration
  id: Siang. Gue nunggu empat jam di warung kopi, minum tiga gelas kopi sachet yang rasanya kayak gula dibakar.
  en: Noon. I waited four hours at the coffee stall, drinking three cups of instant coffee that tasted like burnt sugar.
narration
  id: Kapal biru-putih itu ada di ujung dermaga. Ban bekas masih nutupin setengah namanya. Di sebelahnya, seorang bapak duduk di atas ember terbalik, benerin jaring pake jarum kayu.
  en: The blue and white boat is at the end of the pier. The old tire still hides half its name. Next to it, a man sits on an upturned bucket, mending a net with a wooden needle.

stage
  show raka:neutral left
  show hendra:gruff right transition=fade duration=800

raka:neutral [left]
  id: Pak Hendra?
  en: Pak Hendra?
hendra:gruff [right]
  id: Siapa yang nanya.
  en: Who's asking.
raka:neutral
  id: Raka. Saya nyari temen saya. Sekar. Dia podcaster, sering ke sini.
  en: Raka. I'm looking for a friend. Sekar. She does a podcast, she comes here a lot.
hendra:gruff
  id: Banyak yang ke sini. Saya nggak hafal muka orang.
  en: Lots of people come here. I don't remember faces.

narration
  id: Jarumnya nggak berhenti. Matanya juga nggak naik dari jaring.
  en: His needle doesn't stop. Neither do his eyes leave the net.

raka:neutral
  id: Kapal ini dulu punya Pak Karta, kan?
  en: This boat used to be Pak Karta's, right?

narration
  id: Jarumnya berhenti.
  en: The needle stops.

hendra:wary
  id: Kamu kenal abang saya dari mana?
  en: How do you know my brother?
raka:sad
  id: Setahun lalu, saya harusnya ikut kapal ini. Sabtu, jam setengah enam pagi. Sama Sekar. Saya nggak dateng.
  en: A year ago, I was supposed to go out on this boat. Saturday, five thirty in the morning. With Sekar. I didn't show up.

narration
  id: Pak Hendra ngelihat gue lama. Lama banget, sampai gue mulai ngitung ombak yang nabrak tiang dermaga.
  en: Pak Hendra looks at me for a long time. Long enough that I start counting the waves hitting the pier posts.

hendra:neutral
  id: Anak yang nggak dateng.
  en: The kid who didn't show.
hendra:neutral
  id: Abang saya cerita. Anak perempuan itu nunggu di sini sampai mataharinya tinggi. Terus dia tetep ikut, sendirian, rekam semuanya. Pulangnya dia nggak ngomong sepatah kata pun.
  en: My brother told me. That girl waited here until the sun was high. Then she came out anyway, alone, recorded everything. She didn't say a word the whole way back.

evidence HENDRA_PROOF by=hendra:wary label=ask_hendra
  id: "Terus kamu mau apa dari saya?" Tunjukkan kenapa lo yakin Sekar ke sini.
  en: "So what do you want from me?" Show him why you're sure Sekar came here.
? listener_photo
  +trust_hendra 5
  -> #proof_photo
? ferry_schedule
  +trust_hendra 4
  -> #proof_ferry
? unsent_message
  -trust_hendra 3
  -> #proof_message
? [fallback]
  -trust_hendra 1
  -> #proof_none

narration label=proof_photo
  id: Gue tunjukin foto dari grup. Sekar, jaket hijau, haluan biru-putih di belakangnya. Senin, jam sepuluh kurang tiga belas.
  en: I show him the photo from the group. Sekar, green jacket, the blue and white bow behind her. Monday, thirteen minutes to ten.
hendra:wary
  id: Banyak kapal biru-putih di sini.
  en: There are lots of blue and white boats here.
raka:determined
  id: Yang namanya "Sri Rej" dan nomornya "14" cuma satu, Pak.
  en: Only one has a name starting "Sri Rej" and a number starting "14", sir.
-> #hendra_warns

narration label=proof_ferry
  id: Gue tunjukin foto jadwal kapal dari papan gabus Sekar. Jam setengah enam, dilingkarin dua kali.
  en: I show him the ferry schedule from Sekar's corkboard. Five thirty, circled twice.
hendra:wary
  id: Itu kapal penumpang ke Pari. Bukan kapal saya.
  en: That's the passenger boat to Pari. Not my boat.
raka:determined
  id: Kapal Bapak juga berangkat setengah enam. Dari dulu.
  en: Your boat leaves at five thirty too. It always has.
-> #hendra_warns

narration label=proof_message
  id: Gue tunjukin pesan yang nggak pernah sampai itu. "Ka. Inget jam lima pagi itu? Gue masih di sana."
  en: I show him the message that never arrived. "Ka. Remember five in the morning? I'm still there."
hendra:worried
  id: ...
  en: ...
hendra:gruff
  id: Itu bukan buat saya baca. Simpen.
  en: That's not for me to read. Put it away.
narration
  id: Dia balik ke jaringnya. Jarumnya gerak lagi, lebih cepet dari tadi.
  en: He goes back to his net. The needle moves again, faster than before.
-> #hendra_closed

hendra:gruff label=proof_none
  id: Saya nggak ngerti maksud kamu. Saya nelayan, bukan polisi.
  en: I don't know what you mean. I'm a fisherman, not a policeman.
-> #hendra_closed

hendra:neutral label=hendra_warns
  id: Saya nggak tahu dia di mana.
  en: I don't know where she is.
narration
  id: Dia ngomong pelan, satu-satu, kayak orang yang lagi milih kata di atas papan rapuh. Bukan kayak orang yang nggak tahu.
  en: He says it slowly, one word at a time, like a man choosing where to step on rotten boards. Not like a man who doesn't know.
hendra:worried
  id: Tapi saya kasih tahu satu hal. HP itu.
  en: But I'll tell you one thing. That phone.
narration
  id: Dia ngelirik saku gue. Gue nggak pernah bilang soal HP Sekar.
  en: He glances at my pocket. I never said anything about Sekar's phone.
hendra:worried
  id: Jangan dibawa ke mana-mana. HP bisa dicari. Dan jangan kasih ke siapa pun yang tiba-tiba baik sama kamu.
  en: Don't carry it everywhere. Phones can be tracked. And don't hand it to anyone who's suddenly nice to you.
set
  set hendra_warned true
raka:shocked
  id: Pak. Kalau Bapak tahu sesuatu...
  en: Sir. If you know something...
hendra:kind
  id: Pulang. Jaga adiknya.
  en: Go home. Look after her sister.
-> #hendra_end

hendra:gruff label=hendra_closed
  id: Pulang, Mas. Di sini panas.
  en: Go home. It's hot out here.

narration label=hendra_end
  id: Dia berdiri, ngangkat jaringnya, dan naik ke kapal. Ban bekas di haluannya bergoyang sedikit.
  en: He stands, lifts his net and climbs onto the boat. The old tire on its bow sways a little.
narration
  id: Di belakang ban itu, sekarang gue bisa baca semuanya. "SRI REJEKI. No. 1427."
  en: Behind the tire, now I can read the whole thing. "SRI REJEKI. No. 1427."

stage
  sound sfx_phone_ring.mp3

narration
  id: HP gue bunyi. Bukan HP Sekar. HP gue sendiri.
  en: My phone rings. Not Sekar's. My own.

-> d3_yusuf_call


@conversation d3_yusuf_call chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Ipda Yusuf" title.en="Officer Yusuf"
@scene CALL channel=thread_yusuf day=3 time=12:40 bg=bg_pier_day.webp music=bgm_tense_call.mp3 ring=sfx_phone_ring.mp3 stay="Itu polisi. Kalau gue nggak angkat, dia punya satu alasan lagi buat nggak percaya gue." stay.en="That's the police. If I don't answer, he has one more reason not to believe me."

yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_01.mp3
  id: Mas Raka. Ipda Yusuf. Ada waktu sebentar?
  en: Mr. Raka. Inspector Yusuf. Do you have a moment?
  delivery: formal, a little tired, calling from a noisy station
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_02.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: Rekaman CCTV di TPI sudah saya dapat. Senin, pukul dua puluh satu lima puluh dua. Mbak Sekar turun dari mobil, dekat pintu timur.
  en: I've got the CCTV footage from the fish auction. Monday, nine fifty-two in the evening. Ms. Sekar gets out of a car, near the east entrance.
  delivery: reading from notes, precise
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_03.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: Mobil hatchback, warna perak. Pelatnya tidak terbaca. Pengemudinya tidak turun, dan mobilnya pergi dua menit kemudian.
  en: A hatchback, silver. The plate can't be read. The driver didn't get out, and the car left two minutes later.
  delivery: matter of fact
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_04.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: Ini belum mengubah status kasusnya. Tapi untuk pertama kalinya saya punya sesuatu untuk ditulis selain "keluarga cemas".
  en: This doesn't change the status of the case yet. But for the first time I have something to write down other than "family is anxious".
  delivery: a small, dry warmth, almost an apology
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_05.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv == true]
  id: Saya kirim fotonya ke Anda. Jangan disebar.
  en: I'll send you the still. Don't share it.
  delivery: firm
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_06.mp3 [if lied_to_yusuf == true]
  id: Satu lagi. Kemarin ada yang datang ke kantor. Pacarnya Mbak Sekar. Katanya ada HP cadangan, dan Anda yang pegang.
  en: One more thing. Someone came to the station yesterday. Ms. Sekar's boyfriend. He said there's a spare phone, and that you have it.
  delivery: cooler, measured
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_07.mp3 [if lied_to_yusuf == true]
  id: Anda bilang ke saya tidak ada apa-apa, Mas. Saya ingat itu.
  en: You told me there was nothing. I remember that.
  delivery: cold, letting it sit
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_08.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv != true && lied_to_yusuf == true]
  id: Saya tidak punya dasar untuk minta rekaman apa pun. Statusnya tetap. Pergi atas kemauan sendiri.
  en: I have no grounds to request any footage. The status stays. Left of her own accord.
  delivery: closing a file
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_09.mp3 [if yusuf_cctv != true && lied_to_yusuf != true]
  id: Saya cuma mau mengabari. Tanpa bukti baru, kasus Mbak Sekar tetap orang dewasa yang pergi atas kemauan sendiri. Maaf, Mas.
  en: I just wanted to let you know. Without new evidence, Ms. Sekar's case stays an adult who left of her own accord. I'm sorry.
  delivery: sincere but tired, the decision isn't his

choice TELL_BOAT by=yusuf
  id: Kapal Pak Hendra. Kalau polisi yang nanya, lain ceritanya.
  en: Pak Hendra's boat. The police could question him in ways I can't.
? "Pak, ada kapal namanya Sri Rejeki. Nomor 1427." | "Sir, there's a boat called the Sri Rejeki. Number 1427."
  value tell
  +trust_yusuf 2
  -trust_hendra 2
  set yusuf_knows_boat true
? (Simpan dulu soal kapalnya.) | (Keep the boat to yourself for now.) [silent]
  value keep

yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_10.mp3 [if TELL_BOAT == 'tell']
  id: Sri Rejeki. Satu, empat, dua, tujuh. Saya catat. Jangan ke sana lagi sendirian, Mas.
  en: Sri Rejeki. One, four, two, seven. Noted. Don't go back there alone.
  delivery: writing it down, then a warning
yusuf voice=vo_d3_yusuf_11.mp3
  id: Dan kalau ada yang menghubungi Anda soal HP itu, siapa pun, kabari saya dulu. Sebelum Anda melakukan apa-apa.
  en: And if anyone contacts you about that phone, anyone at all, tell me first. Before you do anything.
  delivery: serious, slower, meaning it

system
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended

-> d3_yusuf_photo [if yusuf_cctv == true]
-> d3_home


@conversation d3_yusuf_photo chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Ipda Yusuf" title.en="Officer Yusuf"
@scene CHAT channel=thread_yusuf day=3 time=12:46 music=bgm_unease.mp3

media IMAGE photo_cctv_still.webp by=yusuf unlock=photo_cctv_still typing=3s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Untuk pegangan Anda. Mohon tidak disebarkan.
  en: For your reference. Please do not share it.
  clue cctv_still
yusuf typing=1.6s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Hati-hati, Mas.
  en: Be careful.

-> d3_home


@conversation d3_home chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Mobil Perak" title.en="The Silver Car"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_living_dusk.webp music=bgm_unease.mp3 day=3 time=17:30

stage
  show raka:neutral left
  show dinda:neutral right

narration
  id: Sore. Gue pulang naik ojek, bau ikan, kulit leher kebakar matahari. Dinda nungguin di ruang tamu dengan dua gelas teh, satu tawar.
  en: Late afternoon. I come home on a bike taxi, smelling of fish, the back of my neck sunburnt. Dinda is waiting in the living room with two glasses of tea, one without sugar.
narration
  id: Gue ceritain semuanya. Ibu-ibu kerang. Papan syahbandar. Kapalnya Pak Karta. Pak Hendra bilang nggak tahu Sekar di mana. Dari cara ngomongnya, gue malah yakin dia tahu.
  en: I tell her everything. The mussel women. The harbor board. Pak Karta's boat. Pak Hendra, who doesn't know where Sekar is in a way that makes me sure he does.

narration
  id: Terus gue tunjukin foto CCTV-nya. Mobil hatchback, pintunya kebuka. Sekar turun.
  en: Then I show her the CCTV still. A hatchback, its door open. Sekar getting out.

dinda:angry
  id: Perak.
  en: Silver.
raka:worried
  id: Iya.
  en: Yeah.
dinda:angry
  id: Mobil Bima perak, Ka. Hatchback.
  en: Bima's car is silver, Ka. A hatchback.
raka:neutral
  id: Banyak mobil perak di Jakarta.
  en: There are lots of silver cars in Jakarta.
dinda:neutral
  id: Lo ngomong gitu karena lo percaya, atau karena lo pengen percaya?
  en: Are you saying that because you believe it, or because you want to?

narration
  id: Gue nggak jawab. Kalau gue nggak jawab, Dinda tahu itu artinya apa. Semua orang di rumah ini tahu.
  en: I don't answer. If I don't answer, Dinda knows what that means. Everyone in this house does.

stage
  sound sfx_notification.mp3

narration
  id: HP Sekar geter di meja. Notifikasi dari nomor yang nggak disimpen. Pesannya panjang, rapi, pake huruf kapital di tempat yang bener.
  en: Sekar's phone buzzes on the table. A notification from an unsaved number. The message is long and neat, with capital letters in all the right places.

-> d3_didit


@conversation d3_didit chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Aditya" title.en="Aditya"
@scene CHAT channel=thread_didit day=3 time=19:20 music=bgm_tense_call.mp3

didit typing=4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Selamat malam. Mohon maaf mengganggu. Saya Aditya, dari bagian community relations PT Bentang Pesisir Makmur.
  en: Good evening. I'm sorry to bother you. My name is Aditya, from community relations at PT Bentang Pesisir Makmur.
media IMAGE photo_didit_card.webp by=didit unlock=photo_didit_card typing=2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Kartu nama saya.
  en: My card.
  clue didit_card
didit typing=4.5s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Nomor ini saya dapat dari Mas Bima. Beliau sangat khawatir. Kami semua turut prihatin atas hilangnya Mbak Sekar.
  en: I got this number from Bima. He is very worried. All of us are deeply sorry about Ms. Sekar's disappearance.

narration
  id: "Bentang Pesisir," kata Dinda pelan. "PT. B."
  en: "Bentang Pesisir," Dinda says quietly. "PT. B."
narration [if heard_of_didit == true]
  id: Aditya. Orang-orang panggil dia Pak Didit. Ibu-ibu kerang bilang senyumnya kebanyakan.
  en: Aditya. People call him Pak Didit. The mussel women said he smiles too much.
narration [if TASYA_PROOF == 'tasya_warning']
  id: Orang PR dari perusahaan yang nawarin sponsor. Yang nelpon Tasya malem-malem. Ramah banget. Terlalu ramah.
  en: The PR man from the company that offered the sponsorship. The one who called Tasya late at night. So friendly. Too friendly.

didit typing=5s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 [if group_alerted == true]
  id: Saya juga dengar grup pendengar Mbak Sekar sempat ramai kemarin pagi. Pasti berat sekali untuk Anda.
  en: I also heard Ms. Sekar's listener group got rather busy yesterday morning. This must be very hard for you.
didit typing=6s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Perusahaan kami ingin membantu. Kami punya pengacara, dan kami bekerja sama dengan laboratorium forensik digital. Kalau HP Mbak Sekar bisa diperiksa dengan benar, mungkin ada petunjuk yang terlewat oleh polisi.
  en: Our company would like to help. We have lawyers, and we work with a digital forensics lab. If Ms. Sekar's phone could be examined properly, there might be clues the police have missed.
didit typing=4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Kurir kami bisa datang ke rumah malam ini, jam delapan. Aman, ada tanda terimanya. Besok pagi hasilnya sudah ada.
  en: Our courier can come to the house tonight at eight. It's safe, with a signed receipt. You'd have the results by tomorrow morning.
didit typing=3s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Salam untuk Dik Dinda juga, ya. Pasti berat sekali untuk adiknya.
  en: Please give my regards to Dinda too. This must be so hard for the younger sister.

narration
  id: Gue nggak pernah nyebut nama Dinda ke siapa pun di luar rumah ini.
  en: I've never said Dinda's name to anyone outside this house.
narration [if hendra_warned == true]
  id: "Jangan kasih ke siapa pun yang tiba-tiba baik sama kamu."
  en: "Don't hand it to anyone who's suddenly nice to you."
narration [if trust_dinda >= 10]
  id: Dinda megang lengan gue. Kenceng. "Jangan," katanya. Cuma itu.
  en: Dinda grips my arm. Hard. "Don't," she says. That's all.
narration [if trust_dinda < 10]
  id: Dinda ngelihat layar, terus ngelihat gue. Dia nggak ngomong apa-apa. Sejak kemarin, dia mulai nunggu gue yang mutusin sendiri.
  en: Dinda looks at the screen, then at me. She doesn't say anything. Since yesterday, she's started leaving the decisions to me.

didit typing=2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Bagaimana, Mas Raka? Kurirnya saya jalankan?
  en: So, Raka? Shall I send the courier?

choice HANDOVER by=didit timeout=15s silent
  id: Gimana?
  en: Well?
? Kirim HP-nya lewat kurir. | Send the phone with the courier.
  value send
? "Saya pikir-pikir dulu, Pak." | "Let me think about it first."
  value stall
? Tunjukin sesuatu ke dia. | Show him something.
  value present
? (Nggak bales.) | (Don't reply.) [default]
  value ignore

player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if HANDOVER == 'send']
  id: Iya, Pak. Silakan kirim kurirnya.
  en: Yes. Please send the courier.
-> d3_handed_over [if HANDOVER == 'send']

player sfx=sfx_msg_send.mp3 [if HANDOVER == 'stall']
  id: Saya pikir-pikir dulu, Pak.
  en: Let me think about it first.
-> #didit_stalled [if HANDOVER == 'stall' || HANDOVER == 'ignore']

evidence DIDIT_PROOF by=didit label=ask_didit
  id: Kirim apa ke dia?
  en: What do you send him?
? threat_message
  -> #didit_slips
? [fallback]
  -> #didit_shrugs

didit typing=5s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 label=didit_slips
  id: Astaga. Saya turut prihatin ada yang mengirim pesan seperti itu, Mas.
  en: Good heavens. I'm sorry someone sent you a message like that.
didit typing=6s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Saran saya sebagai teman, sebaiknya Anda berhenti dulu. Demi keluarganya.
  en: My advice, as a friend, is that you stop for now. For the family's sake.
set
  set didit_slipped true
narration
  id: "Demi keluarganya." Gue taruh layarnya di samping screenshot pesan tengah malem itu. "Demi adiknya."
  en: "For the family's sake." I put the screen next to the screenshot of the midnight message. "For her sister's sake."
narration
  id: Dinda baca dua-duanya, terus ngelihat gue. Nggak ada yang perlu ngomong.
  en: Dinda reads them both, then looks at me. Neither of us needs to say it.
system
  id: Aditya sedang mengetik...
  en: Aditya is typing...
system
  id: Aditya terakhir dilihat 19.26
  en: Aditya last seen 7:26 PM
narration
  id: Dia berhenti ngetik. Dia nggak pernah ngirim apa-apa lagi.
  en: He stops typing. He never sends anything else.
-> d3_silent_call

didit typing=3s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 label=didit_shrugs
  id: Terima kasih sudah memberi tahu saya, Mas. Justru hal-hal seperti ini yang bisa diperiksa lab kami.
  en: Thank you for sharing. That's exactly the kind of thing our lab can look into.
-> #didit_stalled

didit typing=4s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3 label=didit_stalled
  id: Tentu. Silakan dipikirkan baik-baik. Tapi tawaran seperti ini tidak selalu ada, Mas.
  en: Of course. Please think it over carefully. But an offer like this won't always be there.
didit typing=2s sfx=sfx_msg_receive.mp3
  id: Selamat malam.
  en: Good evening.
narration
  id: Jam delapan lewat. Nggak ada motor yang berhenti di depan pagar. Tapi gue tetep ngintip dari jendela atas, dua kali, kayak Sekar dulu.
  en: Eight o'clock comes and goes. No motorbike stops at the gate. But I still look out of the upstairs window, twice, the way Sekar used to.

-> d3_silent_call


@conversation d3_handed_over chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Diserahkan" title.en="Handed Over"
@scene VN bg=bg_sekar_house_gate_night.webp music=bgm_low_tide.mp3 ambience=amb_room_night.mp3 day=3 time=20:02

stage
  sound sfx_courier_motorbike.mp3

narration
  id: Jam delapan lewat dua. Kurirnya pake jaket tanpa logo dan helm yang kacanya nggak dibuka. Dia nyodorin tanda terima. Tanda tangan gue jelek, kayak biasanya.
  en: Two minutes past eight. The courier wears a jacket with no logo and a helmet with the visor down. He holds out a receipt. My signature is as ugly as ever.
narration
  id: HP Sekar masuk ke amplop cokelat. Amplopnya masuk ke tas. Motornya pergi.
  en: Sekar's phone goes into a brown envelope. The envelope goes into a bag. The motorbike leaves.

stage
  cg cg_handed_over.webp unlock=cg_handed_over zoom=2.2 focus=top transition=fade_black duration=1.2s

narration
  id: Lampu belakangnya merah kecil di ujung gang, terus belok, terus nggak ada.
  en: Its tail light is a small red dot at the end of the alley, then it turns, then it's gone.

stage
  cg cg_handed_over_b.webp transition=dissolve duration=1.5s
  cg_move zoom=1 focus=center duration=6s

narration
  id: Dinda nggak ngomong apa-apa malem itu.
  en: Dinda doesn't say anything that night.

stage
  cg none transition=fade_black duration=1s
narration
  id: Paginya, akun cloud Sekar kosong. Foto, catatan, draf, semuanya. Halaman dasbor podcast-nya bilang "akun tidak ditemukan".
  en: In the morning, Sekar's cloud account is empty. Photos, notes, drafts, all of it. Her podcast dashboard says "account not found".
narration
  id: Grup pendengarnya sepi. Nadia nulis "kak?" sekali lagi, tiga hari kemudian. Nggak ada yang bales.
  en: The listener group goes quiet. Nadia writes "kak?" one more time, three days later. Nobody answers.
narration
  id: Seminggu kemudian, Ipda Yusuf nelpon. Laporannya ditutup. Orang dewasa, pergi atas kemauan sendiri. Dia minta maaf, dan kedengerannya dia beneran minta maaf.
  en: A week later, Inspector Yusuf calls. The report is closed. An adult, left of her own accord. He apologizes, and he sounds like he means it.
narration
  id: Gue balik ke Bandung. Gue ngedit iklan asuransi. Kadang, jam lima pagi, gue kebangun dan nggak tahu kenapa.
  en: I go back to Bandung. I edit insurance ads. Sometimes, at five in the morning, I wake up and don't know why.

ending end_07_handed_over BAD
  id: Diserahkan
  en: Handed Over
  summary id: Raka menyerahkan HP Sekar ke kurir Didit. Semua yang Sekar simpan hilang dalam semalam, dan kasusnya ditutup.
  summary en: Raka gave Sekar's phone to Didit's courier. Everything Sekar had kept was gone overnight, and the case was closed.


@conversation d3_silent_call chapter="Hari 3" chapter.en="Day 3" title="Tanpa Suara" title.en="No Voice"
@scene CALL channel=call_private day=3 time=23:41 bg=bg_sekar_room_night.webp music=amb_sea_night.mp3 ambience=amb_generator_night.mp3 ring=sfx_phone_ring.mp3 stay="Nggak. Ada orang di sana." stay.en="No. Someone's there."

narration
  id: Jam dua belas kurang dua puluh. HP Sekar bunyi. Nomor pribadi.
  en: Twenty to midnight. Sekar's phone rings. A private number.
narration
  id: Nggak ada suara. Cuma ombak. Ombak yang pecah pelan di sesuatu yang deket. Dan di belakangnya, mesin. Bukan mesin kapal. Genset.
  en: No voice. Just waves. Waves breaking softly against something close. And behind them, an engine. Not a boat engine. A generator.
player
  id: Halo?
  en: Hello?
narration
  id: Ombak. Genset. Nggak ada yang ngomong.
  en: Waves. The generator. Nobody speaks.
player
  id: Kar?
  en: Kar?

stage
  sound sfx_recorder_click.mp3

narration
  id: Klik.
  en: Click.

wait 900

stage
  sound sfx_recorder_click.mp3

narration
  id: Klik.
  en: Click.
narration
  id: Gue kenal bunyi itu. Gue yang beliin alatnya. Tombol rekam Zoom H5. Dipencet, dilepas. Dua kali.
  en: I know that sound. I bought the thing. The record button on a Zoom H5. Pressed, released. Twice.
player
  id: Sekar. Ini gue. Gue di sini.
  en: Sekar. It's me. I'm here.

wait 1500

system
  id: Panggilan berakhir
  en: Call ended
set
  set heard_silent_call true

stage
  music none fade=2s
  ambience none fade=2s

narration
  id: Gue duduk di lantai kamar Sekar sampai subuh, megangin HP-nya kayak megangin sesuatu yang bisa kabur.
  en: I sit on the floor of Sekar's room until dawn, holding her phone like something that might run away.

-> d4_timeline


